// `e.dist.actor`: virtual actors over rendezvous placement and the document store. The
// generated region (scripts/gen_dist_actor_test.py) holds the silo each of sixteen grains lands
// on before and after a silo is removed (xxhash and an independent rendezvous model, with the
// property that only the removed silo's grains move asserted by the generator) and the reminder
// schedule arithmetic. Sections: activation, placement, state through deactivation (1xx), silo
// failure and re-placement (2xx), reentrancy refusal and turn atomicity (3xx), timers (4xx),
// reminders, durability across a restart and cancellation (5xx), refusals and capacity (6xx).
// Every check has its own exit code.
